        "content": "The most useful starting point is to ask where a recording, poem, or grammatical description comes from and which writing conventions it follows. Regional speech, inherited oral genres, and a proposed written standard illuminate different aspects of Balochi. Keeping them distinct makes it easier to appreciate both the language's shared foundations and the variety of ways its speakers use it. [s1][s2][s3]",
        "source_ids": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]
      }
